==Brief summary of the notice from the university regarding students activities on campus
*University strongly recommend for students to refrain from using on campus facilities and spaces for students activities, which includes student support center, and book shop building. If your association need to use the space for small gathering, please make sure to take necessary action to protect yourself or other from infection by keeping 2 m distance to each other, opening windows and exchanging the air, washing hand before using the space etc.
Please consider the risk that if a case is found among those students who have used those facilities, then all participants may need to stay home and self-isolate.
*As it was stated in the President message in March 18th, campus access for non-university personnel will be restricted.
https://www.u-tokyo.ac.jp/en/about/COVID-19-message.html
