The University of Tokyo is conducting a “Survey on Awareness and Status of Diversity at The University of Tokyo” aimed at all students, faculty, and staff members.
 
1.Period
Tuesday, Dec. 15, 2020 - Wednesday, Jan. 13, 2021
2.Questionnaire
Students
(in English)https://borders.post-survey.com/tokyo01en/
