WFUNA College Leaders at the UN: Korea (CLUN 18) Applications Now Open
 
Applications are open for the 18th College Leaders at the UN: Korea held at the UN Headquarters in New York on August 2026. All Korean students attending universities outside of Korea are eligible for application.
 
This program is prepared in partnership with various Korean and Foreign universities to provide an opportunity for college students to represent their schools at the UN Headquarters, interacting with UN officials and diplomats.
 
Interested students should submit a completed application form ( https://www.wfuna.or.kr/program_clun ) by no later than April 12th, 2026.
 
Promotional video:
https://bit.ly/2024_14thCLUN_Video (CLUN 14)
https://bit.ly/2024_13thCLUN_Video (CLUN 13)
 
- Pre-Training (via online/offline): May 2nd, May 9th, May 23rd, 2026
- Training in New York: August 3rd to August 7th, 2026
- Application form: https://www.wfuna.or.kr/program_clun
- Application deadline: April 12th, 2026 11:59pm KST (10:59 EST)
- For inquiries, please contact yjlee@wfuna.org

